      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing a deep sense of loss, and it is completely understandable that you feel disconnected from the person you once were. That feeling of being a \"shell\" is a heavy burden to carry, especially when your identity felt so tied to your former self. Please know that this profound quietness is a valid response to such a major life change, and reaching out is a brave first step toward finding a new sense of self.",
